[541.22154, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m43\u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;231mE042,2026-10-31T11:28Z,4,an\u001b[39Glyst,\"The a\u001b[51Galyst's ERA m\u001b[65Gssed three real modes that are plainly \u001b[105Gresent in\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B its own \u001b[21Gransfer functions.\u001b[40G6.2184, 7.9209 and 8.5297 Hz were reported by the v\u001b[92Grifier only, and a sig\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bnificant\u001b[20Gl\u001b[22Gcal |H| maximum sits at each one on 44, 32 and 25 of the 52 channels in\u001b[94Gthe\u001b[98GANALYST's own H \r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B-- more\u001b[19Gp\u001b[21Gr-channel s\u001b[33Gpport \u001b[40Ghan two modes the analy\u001b[64Gt\u001b[66Gdi\u001b[70Greport and both nodes accepted (7.46 Hz on\u001b[113G4\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;231m of 5\u001b[17G, 8.\u001b[22G7 Hz on 4 of 52).\",c\u001b[45G bug,verifier,\"The v\u001b[66Grifier found them independently; the critic show\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bed both nodes' median-|H| maxima contain\u001b[52Gthem; reconciliation then counted the per-channel support in \r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bhe analyst's own data, which i\u001b[42G where\u001b[53Gomission becomes undeniable.\",\"All three accepted into the re\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bconc\u001b[16Gled mode list. The \u001b[37Galy\u001b[41Gt's ERA\u001b[49Gpole-stability\u001b[64Gcri\u001b[68Gerion is \u001b[78Ghe susp\u001b[86Gct, not its transfer functio\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bns. Not\u001b[19Gre-run: it would cost more than the pilot \u001b[63Gs, and the modes\u001b[80Gare\u001b[84Gestablish\u001b[94Gd\u001b[96Gwith\u001b[101Gu\u001b[105Gt.\",18\u001b[112G  \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m44\u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;231mE043,2026-10-31T11:28Z,4,both\u001b[41Gnodes,\"Cross-method ag\u001b[64Geement \u001b[72Gurned out not to be sufficient. The 7.43-7\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B.46 Hz\u001b[18Gmode was found by\u001b[36GBOTH nod\u001b[45Gs wit\u001b[51G i\u001b[54Gdependent methods and matched at 0.037 Hz\u001b[96Gseparation, and it\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bis s\u001b[17Gill no\u001b[24G est\u001b[29Gblish\u001b[36G:\u001b[38Git sits on\u001b[49Gthe 7.45 Hz boundary, whi\u001b[75Gh reconciliation resolved as a\u001b[106Ggain cha\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bnge \u001b[16Gn both\u001b[23Gref\u001b[27Grence channels PLUS a ge\u001b[52Gu\u001b[54Gne chang\u001b[63G in the force-to-accelera\u001b[89Gi\u001b[91Gn relation, with the \u001b[113Gw\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bo drive monitors disagreeing by a factor 5 about what the drive did. Its per-channel support is als\u001b[111G th\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Be w\u001b[15Gakest of any\u001b[28Gagreed mode, 4 of 52.\",physics error,orchestrator,\"reconcile/r4b_gain.py\u001b[101Gseparated\u001b[111Ggai\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mn from physics by asking whether each channel's OFF-TONE noise scaled with its tone, which neither node\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231m nor the critic had tried; the mode's weak per-channel support came out of r1_modes.py.\",\"Mode demoted \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mdespite the agreement. The process lesson is recorded for PROCESS_REPORT.md: two nodes sharing an instr\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mument share its artefacts, so agreement between them bounds method error, not instrumental error. Both \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231mnodes referenced ch1111, which is exactly the channel at fault.\",26                                    \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0Allowed by auto mode\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m fil\u001b[14G, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[6G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[33;1H\u001b[31;3H\u001b[?25h"]
