1b[23Gmi\u001b[26Gday ET \u001b[34Ge\u001b[36Gdline, and PROCESS_REPORT.md, SUMMARY.md, the figure and DEMO_NOTES.\u001b[105Gd are \u001b[112Gtill \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246munwritten. \u2192 Cut it (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mPrinting gate decision marker\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf  $ cat\u001b[12G> reconcile/mk_modes.py <<'EOF'\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m#!/usr/bin/env python3\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m\"\"\"Build results/modes_reconciled.csv -- the adjudicated mode list, after the stop-point-4 gate.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;246mStatus is set by reconciliation and approved by Vivek at the gate: 11 headline, 2 tentative,\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;246m2\u001b[8Gwithdrawn. Frequenc\u001b[28Ges and damping come from w\u2026\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;174m*\u001b[39m\u001b[33;1H\u001b[31;3H\u001b[?25h"]
