[677.772474, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 9 +\u001b[38;5;231m8.0990,0.050,headline,both,8.0990,8.1274,+0.0284,0.0034,0.0006,0.00615,37,35,0.2676,false,\"the\u001b[106G8.099/8.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231m172 split is 0.073 Hz, below the 0.1 Hz drive grid, so median-|H| peak-picking cannot separate the pair\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231m by construction while ERA can\"                                                                        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 10 +\u001b[38;5;231m8.1720,0.050,headline,analyst,8.1720,8.1274,-0.0446,0.0048,0.0010,0.00615,4,4,0.1946,false,second pole \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mof the pair above; inside the collaboration's 8.0-9.0 Hz hunt                                          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 11 +\u001b[38;5;231m8.5297,0.050,headline,verifier,,8.5297,,,,0.00586,25,25,0.1631,false,as 6.2184 Hz: present on 25 of 52 \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mchannels in the analyst's own H (E042)                                                                 \u001b[115G\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 12 +\u001b[38;5;231m8.7940,0.050,headline,both,8.7940,8.7834,-0.0106,0.0038,0.0001,0.00569,45,43,0.4274,false,inside the co\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231mllaboration's 8.0-9.0 Hz hunt                                                                          \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 13 +\u001b[38;5;231m7.4640,0.050,tentative,both,7.4640,7.4269,-0.0371,0.0020,0.0001,0.00673,4,3,0.4919,false,\"DEMOTED despi\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mte cross-method agreement at 0.037 Hz: sits on the 7.45 Hz boundary, where ch1111 and ch1112 off-tone n\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231moise jump x1.82 and x1.67 (a gain change) AND their tone/off-tone ratios move x0.37 and x1.86 in opposi\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mte directions (a real drive-point resonance). The two drive monitors disagree by a factor 5 about the d\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mrive, and per-channel support is 4 of 52, the weakest of any agreed mode (E043)\"                       \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 14 +\u001b[38;5;231m8.2850,0.050,tentative,analyst,8.2850,,,0.0112,0.0004,,10,7,0.0816,false,\"a local |H| maximum on only 1\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231m0 of 52 channels in the analyst's own H and 7 of 52 in the verifier's; median |H| is a shoulder, not a \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mpeak (E041)\"                                                                                           \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 15 +\u001b[38;5;231m5.4940,0.050,withdrawn,analyst,5.4940,,,0.0097,0.0007,,0,0,0.0837,false,\"no local |H| maximum on ANY of\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231m the 52 channels in either node's data; median |H| falls monotonically through it. It is the ch1111 gai\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231mn step: off-tone noise x1.836 tracks the tone x1.729 while the independent accelerometer ch1112 is flat\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m    +\u001b[38;5;231m (E036, E041)\"                                                                                         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 16 +\u001b[38;5;231m2.5270,0.050,withdrawn,analyst,2.5270,,,0.0030,0.0014,,,,0.2619,false,\"one channel only (ch962, the noi\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231msiest of the four sampled, 39.8 mV peak excursions against 7.6-19.7) and on the first grid point, 2.50 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m    +\u001b[38;5;231mHz, where no local maximum is definable (E041)\"                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0Allowe\u001b[13G by auto mode\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[33;1H\u001b[31;3H\u001b[?25h"]
